# Second half of 2026-09-29-6, split into its own playbot invocation per
# direction.md's own lesson under hypothesis 1: a second `open #hash` inside
# one script is a same-document fragment navigation (the app clears the hash
# after reading it), not a reload, so it never starts a real second pull.
open #b=cold&s=25&h=1
targets
tap class:warrior:protection
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
state
shot idle-open

play idle 200
bill
says
state
shot idle-end
